     "content_html": "The variable <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">i</code> is initialized to <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">16</code>, and the <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">while</code> loop executes with <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">i = 16</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">8</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">4</code>, and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">2</code>. In each loop's iteration, the variable <code>exp</code>'s value is incremented by 1. Hence, at the end of the loop, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">exp = 4</code>. Since the loop terminates without interruption, the <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">else</code> statement after the loop is executed and prints <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">16 is 2 to the 4</code>."
